  "content": "<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">猫</span><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">娘</span><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">包</span><span style=\"color:#343e4e\"></span><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">深</span><span style=\"color:#3598db\">蓝</span></strong></h2><p>猫娘包 - 深蓝版是一款将蓝色及其衍生色与黑色融合，形成统一和谐混色的资源包。</p><hr><h3><strong>模组支持</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neko-economie-shop-systeme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">猫娘经济</a></span></li>\n</ul><hr><h3><strong>纹理</strong></h3><p>由<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nekotenshi/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Nekotenshi</span></a>创作</p><hr><h3><strong>支持与反馈：</strong></h3><p>如果您有功能建议或遇到错误，可通过以下方式联系我：</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\">Discord服务器</span>：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/kwCfHSM9vc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/kwCfHSM9vc</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\">GitHub</span>：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Nekotenshi01/Neko-Pack-Dark-Blue-Depot-Public\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Nekotenshi01/Neko-Pack-Dark-Blue-Depot-Public</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\">CurseForge</span>：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nekotenshi/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/nekotenshi/projects</a></span></li>\n</ul>",
